{ "Identifier":       {"ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "MAS-APP-V1.0-I01", "AIMName": "1MAS-APP-V1.0-I01"},
  "Header":           "MAS-APP-V1.0",

  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "OnDegraded":       "Continue",
  "Description":      "MPAI as a Service App: the Module the MPAI-MAS workflow runs over. It lets a User Agent that has not yet chosen an App speak to the person through a Speaking Avatar. Response and Scene Rendering renders the Text supplied by the User Agent into the Machine Speech and the lip-synced Machine Face Descriptors; when the User Agent also supplies a Personal Status, speech and face are rendered with it, otherwise neutrally. Automatic Speech Recognition hears the person's spoken reply to a question the Module asked - another App or not - and gives it as Text. Acquisition and delivery are the User Agent, not sub-AIMs.",

